d inspected: matching title/author and exact edition source. Language established bibliographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"Whole Wool/Silo novel includes the original five serial instalments and matches existing WorkISBN9781476733951; not five separate Works. Reject tiny97x150cover of2014ISBN9789021457178; choose same novel2013ISBN9789021447735."}],"work_id":249,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":165,"text":"In een ondergrondse silo leven mensen volgens regels die hun overleving zouden garanderen. De buitenwereld is giftig en vertrekken lijkt een doodvonnis. Wanneer sheriff Holston na de dood van zijn vrouw toch naar buiten wil, raakt de vanzelfsprekendheid van die orde aangetast. De roman onderzoekt hoe een afgesloten gemeenschap met gevaar, loyaliteit en informatie omgaat wanneer niemand precies weet waarop haar zekerheden berusten.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484415/silo.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024580095","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024580095"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":277,"title":"De bron der verheffing","isbn_13":"9789024580095","isbn_10":"9024580099","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024580095","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024580095"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-005-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/206557/de-bron-der-verheffing.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/206557/de-bron-der-verheffing.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:19:07.904Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"7279de05