liographically, never from jacket alone."},{"reviewNote":"Rien van der Kraan is translator in mixed source credits, not replacement for Brandon Sanderson."}],"work_id":277,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":19,"text":"Na de val van de Opperheer moeten Vin en Elend helpen een nieuwe samenleving op te bouwen. Hun overwinning heeft de problemen echter niet beëindigd: verschillende legers bedreigen de stad en de toekomst blijft onzeker. Een oude overlevering over de Bron der Verheffing lijkt een mogelijkheid te bieden. Terwijl politieke beslissingen steeds urgenter worden, zoekt Vin naar de betekenis van een macht die nauwelijks iemand begrijpt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/206557/de-bron-der-verheffing.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024595532","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024595532"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":281,"title":"De Grote Jacht","isbn_13":"9789024595532","isbn_10":"9024595533","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","open_library_edition_id":null}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024595532","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024595532"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-005-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1543180/de-grote-jacht.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1543180/de-grote-jacht.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:19:10.007Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"21d1255218cf8c32e2e7710aa301cc3f0e9e54a80c8ba4f8e9804763b768c5ee"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000402219_De_grote_jacht_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:30:23.233Z","http":200,"sha256":"631bbb275db41e9c36b2d788